; Documentation conformance: compiled mirrors of what doc/ shows.
; test_manual_transcripts pins the failure renderings the manual's
; transcripts print; test_migrating is the migration reference's compile
; matrix (CHANGES.md's 0.2.0 entry); test_cookbook mirrors
; doc/cookbook.md's recipes; test_stateful mirrors
; doc/manual/stateful-testing.md's call sites.

; The first two drive suites through Runner.execute in-process with
; synthetic configs and print through the shared meta harness
; (test/unit/harness.ml), so their one-liners carry the tree-wide summary
; dialect. The last two run as plain windtrap suites through [run] and
; need no harness — windtrap renders them.

(tests
 (names test_manual_transcripts test_migrating test_cookbook test_stateful)
 (libraries windtrap unix harness))
